#: ../../source/users/project/properties/display.rst:4
msgid "Display project properties"
msgstr "显示项目属性"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/display.rst:6
msgid ""
"The `project properties`_ can be displayed in a PopUP window from `menu "
"bar`_ and `projects panel`_."
msgstr ""
"`项目属性 <project properties_>`_ 可以从 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 和 `项目面板 <projects "
"panel_>`_ 在 PopUP 窗口中显示。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/display.rst:9
msgid "Project properties from menu bar"
msgstr "来自菜单栏的项目属性"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/display.rst:11
msgid ""
"Select **Project > Project properties** menu item to display the `project "
"properties`_ PopUP window from the active project."
msgstr ""
"选择 **Project > Project属性** 菜单项，以显示当前项目的 `项目属性 <project properties_>`_ PopUP "
"窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/display.rst:16
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech project menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 项目菜单"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/display.rst:21
msgid ""
"If more than one `projects`_ is opened, be sure that the active `projects`_ "
"is the correct before changing properties."
msgstr "如果打开了超过一个 `项目 <projects_>`_，则在改变属性之前，请确定激活的 `项目 <projects_>`_ 是正确的。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/display.rst:25
msgid "Project properties from project panel"
msgstr "项目小组的项目属性"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/display.rst:27
msgid ""
"The advantage of displaying the `project properties`_ from `projects panel`_"
" is the possibility to choose `projects`_ which are opened and are not the "
"active `project`_."
msgstr ""
"从 `项目面板 <project properties_>`_ 显示 `项目属性 <projects panel_>`_ "
"的优点是有可能选择已打开而不是活动 `项目 <projects_>`_ 的 `项目 <project_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/display.rst:30
msgid "Right click on the `project`_ from the tree of the `projects panel`_."
msgstr "右键点击 `项目 <project_>`_ 从树上 `专题小组讨论会 <projects panel_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/display.rst:31
msgid ""
"Select **Project properties** to display the `project properties`_ PopUP "
"window."
msgstr "选择 **项目属性** 以显示 `项目属性 <project properties_>`_ PopUP 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/display.rst:36
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech projects panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech项目小组"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/display.rst:40
msgid ""
"If the `projects panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from "
"**Settings > Display > Projects**."
msgstr "如果 `项目面板 <projects panel_>`_ 不显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 项目** 显示。"
